==Old English==

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/treːow/|lang=ang}}

===Etymology 1===
From West {{etyl|gem-pro|ang}} {{m|gem-pro|*trewwō}}. Cognate with {{etyl|dum|-}} {{m|dum|trouwe}} ({{etyl|nl|-}} {{m|nl|trouw}}), {{etyl|osx|-}} {{m|osx|treuwa}}, {{etyl|goh|-}} {{m|goh|triuwa}} ({{etyl|de|-}} {{m|de|Treue}}).

====Noun====
{{ang-noun|f|head=trēow}}

# [[truth]], [[fidelity]]

